lder\n\nClose editor, open editor again. Will see the old plugins still referenced in editor settings.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116393/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116393/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}